1.1 BRAND PERSONALITY
─────────────────────
GROOM is a premium, luxury grooming studio. The frontend must communicate:
  - Exclusivity without arrogance
  - Warmth with professionalism
  - Modern African luxury aesthetic
  - Confidence and precision (like a master barber)

Visual Direction: Dark luxury with gold/amber accents. Think cinematic barbershop
meets high-end spa. Deep charcoal or near-black backgrounds, warm lighting tones,
tactile glass-surface cards (glassmorphism), cinematic scroll animations.

NOT allowed: generic purple gradients, stock photo vibes, cheap SaaS blue.

