1.5 ANIMATION & MOTION SYSTEM
──────────────────────────────
  Philosophy: Cinematic, intentional, never gratuitous.

  Easing curves:
    --ease-luxury:    cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94)
    --ease-spring:    cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)
    --ease-out-expo:  cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1)

  Standard durations:
    --dur-fast:       150ms   (micro-interactions, hover states)
    --dur-normal:     300ms   (page transitions, modal open)
    --dur-slow:       600ms   (section reveals, hero animations)
    --dur-cinematic:  1200ms  (page load sequences)

  Required animations:
    - Hero text: staggered word-by-word reveal with blur-in (filter: blur → 0)
    - Section entry: translateY(40px) → 0 + opacity 0 → 1, triggered by IntersectionObserver
    - Cards: subtle 3D tilt on hover (rotateX/Y via mouse position tracking)
    - Jude orb: continuous slow pulse + ripple rings when active/speaking
    - Button press: slight scale-down (0.97) with gold shadow bloom
    - Page load: full-screen curtain wipe (vertical slide-up reveal)
    - Scroll progress: thin gold line at top of viewport

