PAGE 3: BOOKING FLOW
────────────────────────────

  This is the primary transactional page. Multi-step form flow.
  Layout: Centered single-column, max-width 640px
  Step indicator: Top progress bar (4 steps, gold fill)

  STEP 1 — SELECT SERVICE
    - Filterable service list (radio-select cards)
    - Each card: icon + name + duration + price
    - Selected state: gold border + checkmark badge
    - "Next: Choose Time →" button

  STEP 2 — SELECT DATE & TIME
    - Custom calendar component:
        Dark glass style
        Disabled dates (fully booked shown in muted, crossed)
        Available dates clickable
        Today highlighted
    - Time slots grid (e.g., 9:00, 9:30, 10:00 …) — dynamically loaded
    - Booked slots: muted, disabled, strikethrough
    - Available slots: gold outline, selectable
    - Selected slot: solid gold fill
    - System enforces 1-hour walk-in buffer (unavailable in final slot)
    - If no slots: "This day is fully booked. Next available: [date]" + option to join waitlist

  STEP 3 — PERSONAL DETAILS
    Fields:
      - Full Name [text input]
      - Phone Number [tel input, Ghana format hint: 024XXXXXXX]
      - Email Address [email input]
      - Preferred Reminder Method [radio: Email | WhatsApp]
      - Special Requests / Notes [textarea, optional]
    All inputs: glass-style dark input field
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)
      focus: border-color gold + subtle gold glow
      placeholder: muted gold

  STEP 4 — PAYMENT
    Summary card:
      - Selected service
      - Date & Time
      - Assigned staff (auto-assigned, displayed)
      - Full price + 30% deposit amount in GHS
    Payment instruction:
      - Text: "Jude will send a payment link to [email]. Complete payment to confirm."
      - Or: CTA button "Request Payment Link" → triggers Paystack link generation
    Reference input:
      - "Enter transaction reference after payment"
      - [text input, monospace font, UPPERCASE auto-transform]
    Verify button: [Verify & Confirm Booking]
    Verification states:
      - Loading spinner (gold animated)
      - Success: Green checkmark + confirmation card
      - Duplicate: Warning message "Reference already used"
      - Failed: Error message + retry option

  CONFIRMATION SCREEN:
    Full-screen success state
    Elements:
      - Animated gold checkmark
      - "You're Booked!" headline
      - Booking summary card (name, service, date, time, barber)
      - Reminder info (method selected)
      - "Add to Google Calendar" button
      - "Share Booking" button
      - "Back to Home" ghost link

