SECTION 7 — RESPONSIVE & ACCESSIBILITY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  Breakpoints:
    Mobile:   < 640px
    Tablet:   640px – 1024px
    Desktop:  > 1024px
    Wide:     > 1440px

  Responsive rules:
    - All grids collapse to single column on mobile
    - Touch targets minimum 44px × 44px
    - Booking multi-step: full-screen on mobile
    - Admin dashboard: sidebar → tab bar on mobile

  Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA):
    - All interactive elements keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Escape)
    - Focus ring: 2px solid gold outline, 2px offset
    - aria-labels on all icon-only buttons
    - Form fields linked to labels via htmlFor/id
    - Color contrast ratio: minimum 4.5:1 for body text
    - Screen reader announcements for loading states and errors
    - Skip to main content link (visually hidden, visible on focus)

  Performance targets:
    - LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s
    - CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1
    - FID / INP: < 200ms
    - Lazy-load images below fold
    - Preload hero fonts (Cormorant Garamond, DM Sans)

